From 71dfcf322f52cf0315480dbd23dfb581a34f39fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:42:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [Hades] Comments: the evidence of 1.1 said without the dates
 and hours of tests and the names of test builds

The comments that 1.1 added keep what was measured and why, as before, without the dates and hours of
the sessions in which it was seen, the names of the test builds of 1.1, or "of the tests": "an RTX 4080
SUPER" and "an LG C5" where they said "the RTX 4080 SUPER of the tests". The log line of HDMI FRL on
the menus says the same in those words. Nothing else changes.
